    {
      "url" : "text",
      "valueMarkdown" : "Maintenance search expression: `multiaxial_descendantsof:(LP16048-8 OR LP392055-2) AND system:urine`. The compose anchors at two trunk LP codes - LP16048-8 and LP392055-2 - using `concept is-a` filters scoped to SYSTEM=LP7681-2 (urine) and CLASSTYPE=1 (lab test). To regenerate: re-run the search expression as a LOINC hierarchy query, add any newly-discovered trunk LP code as another is-a filter, then re-expand."
    }],
